Let's build banking that works for people, one clean line of code at a time.

At DKB Code Factory , we're building the mobile banking app that small and mid-sized businesses actually need.

As a Junior Android Developer , you'll help turn that vision into a reliable, intuitive mobile experience. Working with Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, and modern Android technologies, you'll develop features that make everyday banking easier for our customers.

You'll collaborate with experienced teammates, contribute to technical decisions, and gradually take ownership of features from development to release. This is an opportunity to grow your engineering skills while building a product that makes a real difference.

